Steven: Hi!{be01}
You’re that Trainer I met in Dewford!{be01}
... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...
... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...{be01}
Oh, okay, you’re {0100:0}.
I’ll remember it.{be01}
{0100:0}.{be01}
In this vast world, there are many
kinds of Pokémon.{be00}
They come in many types.{be01}
Do you raise different types?
Or do you raise only Pokémon of a{be00}
certain type?{be01}
What do you think as a Trainer?{be01}
Sorry, it’s not my place to ask, is it?{be01}
Well, anyway, I hope to see you
again.

玛莉：太棒了！太棒了！
你到底是谁？！{be01}
我就知道发现你的时候
一定会有什么惊喜！{be01}
哦，让我解释一下。我们四处旅行
采访各种各样的训练家。{be01}
那么，你愿意抽点时间
接受我们的采访吗？

Gabby: Wow, you are something!{be01}
You’ve gotten a lot stronger - a lot -
since we last battled.{be01}
We were right about you when we
spotted you as a hot Trainer.{be01}
So, anyway, what do you think?
Are you willing to give us an interview{be00}
this time?

玛莉：嗯，没错！
这句话作为结尾太完美了！{be01}
我有预感这期节目
一定会很精彩。{be01}
说不定会在电视上播出，
记得关注我们哦！{be01}
好！
下次见！

就算没有船，
也可以用学会了{be00}
冲浪的宝可梦渡海。{be01}
你可以依靠宝可梦
做很多事情！
